                "value": null,
                "duration": null,
                "durationMap": null,
                "chatType": 0
              },
              "content": "有的肥料，会让蔬果作物结果变多，\n有的肥料，能让蔬果作物结果更优质，\n还有的能让蔬果作物加速生长~！",
              "content_l10n": {
                "$type": "miHoYo.HYG.Localization.LocalizationString, Assembly-Common",
                "textId": "Performance_820201_1085289379_content",
                "value": "有的肥料，会让蔬果作物结果变多，\n有的肥料，能让蔬果作物结果更优质，\n还有的能让蔬果作物加速生长~！",
                "duration": null,
                "durationMap": null,
                "chatType": 0
              },
              "nextRule": 0,
              "guardPeriod": 0.0,
              "desc": null,
              "voiceText": null,
