                "value": null,
                "duration": null,
                "durationMap": null,
                "chatType": 0
              },
              "content": "{A期待}而且嘛，配肥学起来不难的。\n<style=Highlight>食物</style>、<style=Highlight>生物</style>和<style=Highlight>植物</style>，还有<style=Highlight>材料</style>嘛，\n都能放进肥料桶里，搅吧搅吧~配成肥料。",
